  "key_finding": "On 6.18 (CONFIG_PER_VMA_LOCK), mmbench pf page faults are served by per-VMA read locks and the speculative path, NOT by mmap_lock: only 50 mmap_lock events (15 releases = 5 arena-reset cycles x3) occur in the covered window vs 1013798 page faults. The few acquisitions are the benchmark's periodic arena reset (munmap 718MB + fresh mmap) and short read locks.",
